    "why": "Live disassembly of all three helpers (this session) shows none of them read city_instance+0x10 or the building descriptor table (RAM 0x021778EC) at all. 0x02095a5c reads the WONDER table (literal resolves to wonder_table_base+0x48 = 0x0217b518+0x48) for its low-range argument values and a separate 8-byte-stride table (0x021c87f0) for its high-range values. 0x020957fc reads a civilization-scoped word array at 0x021c8b98 and a small ruleset/game-state struct at 0x021c83bc, and internally calls the already-proven has_researched() (0x020957a0) and 0x02095a5c. 0x02096a58 reads three parallel tables at 0x021768cc/0x0219fad8/0x0219faf0/0x02182980 with an unresolved nested-lookup structure. None of these touch the building table or city+0x10.",
